<title>BRAZIL: Brazil BCN first half net 76.2 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil BCN first half net 76.2 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private bank BCN, or Banco de Credito Nacional, sent the following statement to local stock exchanges on its first half results.</p>
<p>			     H1 1997</p>
<p>    Net profit	    76.261 million</p>
<p>    Shr net		 0.00132 real</p>
<p>    Net worth	     1.08 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
